    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Create and configure custom product attributes in <b>Adobe Commerce (ACCS)</b> to support GSUSA catalog management, merchandising, product personalization, and NetSuite product synchronization.</p>

<p>The attributes will be used to define product metadata, pricing, classification, merchandising information, and personalization options required for GSUSA products.</p>

<p>These attributes will also support integration with <b>NetSuite, Middleware, Adobe Assets, and EDS storefront</b>.</p>

<p><a href="https://girlscoutsconnect.sharepoint.com/:x:/r/sites/GSMNewBuild/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BA198BB49-5153-4383-AFDC-BE11813AC334%7D&amp;file=Matrix%20Child%20Items%20from%20NetSuite.xls&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://girlscoutsconnect.sharepoint.com/:x:/r/sites/GSMNewBuild/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BA198BB49-5153-4383-AFDC-BE11813AC334%7D&amp;file=Matrix%20Child%20Items%20from%20NetSuite.xls&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true</a> </p>

<p><a href="https://girlscoutsconnect.sharepoint.com/:x:/r/sites/GSMNewBuild/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B5C047F19-38E5-4CE3-98E4-D78E9B89D5B0%7D&amp;file=Matrix_Child_Items.csv&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://girlscoutsconnect.sharepoint.com/:x:/r/sites/GSMNewBuild/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B5C047F19-38E5-4CE3-98E4-D78E9B89D5B0%7D&amp;file=Matrix_Child_Items.csv&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true</a> </p>

<h3><a name="AttributeCreation"></a>Attribute Creation</h3>

<p>Attributes mentioned in below sheet would be created in ACCS- <a href="https://girlscoutsconnect.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/GSMNewBuild/IgDHWX040nRYSoIqX0uZJF9HAehyGvYan8JmadEwyCkBjlI?e=eVQy6R" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://girlscoutsconnect.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/GSMNewBuild/IgDHWX040nRYSoIqX0uZJF9HAehyGvYan8JmadEwyCkBjlI?e=eVQy6R</a></p>

<hr />

<h2><a name="Dependencies"></a>Dependencies</h2>

<ul>
	<li>NetSuite Product Data Model</li>
	<li><b>EDS Product Display attibutes (GSUSA)</b></li>
	<li>Adobe Assets Enablement</li>
	<li><b>List of Searchable Attributes (GSUSA)</b></li>
	<li><b>Facets</b>  (GSUSA)</li>
</ul>


<hr />

<h2><a name="AcceptanceCriteria%3A"></a>Acceptance Criteria:</h2>

<ul>
	<li>All attributes created in ACCS</li>
	<li>Attributes grouped into attribute sets (<a href="https://girlscouts.atlassian.net/browse/EC-244" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://girlscouts.atlassian.net/browse/EC-244</a> )</li>
	<li>Attributes visible in Product Admin UI</li>
	<li>Attributes mapped for NetSuite integration documentation</li>
	<li>Sample products available in the Admin UI</li>
</ul>

